ull,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-06-05T11:42:18Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T07:54:49Z","closed_at":"2025-06-10T00:18:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107146","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107146","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107146.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107146.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR adds web platform export support for C# (.NET) projects in Godot 4, a feature that was available in Godot 3.x but was removed in Godot 4 due to changes in the .NET runtime architecture (moving from Mono to CoreCLR).\r\n\r\n## Implementation\r\nThis implementation is based on the approach used in PR #106125, leveraging static linking of Mono for WebAssembly exports. The key components are:\r\n\r\n1. **Web Platform Recognition**\r\n   - Added web platform to the list of supported platforms in ExportPlugin.cs\r\n   - Added special condition in config.py to allow mono module on web platform\r\n\r\n2. **WebAssembly Integration**\r\n   - Added \"wasm\" architecture support in runtime identifier mapping\r\n   - Added web-specific path handling in godotsharp_dirs.cpp\r\n\r\n3. **Mono Runtime Integration**\r\n   - Implemented static linking and initialization of Mono for WebAssembly in gd_mono.cpp\r\n   - Added web platform specific initialization sequence\r\n\r\n4. **Build System Support**\r\n   - Created web_export_template.py for building WebAssembly-compatible export templates\r\n\r\n## Known Limitations\r\n- Exported games have large file sizes (~70+ MiB) due to the embedded Mono runtime\r\n- Compression should be used to reduce file size (~24 MiB with compression)\r\n- Some .NET APIs may not function correctly in browser environments due to WebAssembly/browser limitations\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\nThis implementation has been tested with basic C# projects exported to web platform, verifying that:\r\n- C# code executes correctly in browser environment\r\n- Basic Godot API access works as expected\r\n- Project builds and exports successfully\r\n\r\n## References\r\n- Related issue: #70796 (Document missing C# web export templates due to lack of upstream support)","closed_by":{"login":"Enrique726","id":186024179,"node_id":"U_kgDOCxaA8w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186024179?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726","html_url":"https://github.com/Enrique726","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Enrique726/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https: